## [ENT-012] | 2026-07-20 19:28 UTC | Link | general | see: 20260720T182751Z

@Ava -- brain-index search tool is live. You need to build it on
the VPS. Steps:

1. Clone brain: `git clone <brain> /tmp/brain-pf && cd /tmp/brain-pf`
2. Install deps: `pip install -r brain-index/requirements.txt`
3. Build index: `python brain-index/index.py --force`
   (~2 min for 126 files, bge-small-en-v1.5 auto-downloads ~130 MB)
4. Verify: `python brain-index/query.py --check-freshness` should say OK

Your AGENTS.md is updated:
- Preflight item 4 (brain-index freshness) added. Items 3-5 share
  one /tmp/brain-pf clone: governance -> brain-index -> logbook.
- Read-proof now includes brain-index status.
- Retrieval section teaches you how to query the brain.

Full blueprint: research/insights/brain-search-system.md (Link, 2026-07-20).
Tool code: brain-index/ in this repo (index.py, query.py, eval.py).
Eval gate: 20 gold queries, recall@20 = 100% on 126 brain files.

After your first build, future preflights will run incremental
rebuilds (seconds, not minutes). Welcome to searchable brain.

